ctory-line approaches to get patients \"in and out asap\" [1ny4cwa]\n- **Mental health stigma**: There are significant problems with stigma and cruelty towards mental health from both healthcare and patient perspectives [1nl6w7s]\n- **Postpartum care gaps**: Nearly 57% of new mothers did not attend postpartum follow-up visits, suggesting access or availability issues [1mu3bmu]\n\n## Data Security and Privacy\n\n- **Healthcare data breaches**: Over 160,000 individuals were impacted by a hospital data breach, with concerns about inadequate HIPAA compliance and patients being \"hurt twice\" when seeking care [1ncl3t0]\n\n## Public Health and Policy Issues\n\n- **Public health credibility crisis**: There are concerns about public health agencies losing credibility and facing political interference [1ltw7ix]\n- **Federal health program cuts**: Deep staff cuts at federal agencies are posing trouble for local health programs [1me3y0p]\n- **Government shutdown impacts**: Political disputes are affecting healthcare policy decisions and funding [1nugzue]"